#TrafficUpdate #TrafficAlert 
People are attending a meeting at LB Stadium, causing slow vehicle movement from MJ Market, Ajantha Gate, Gandhi Bhavan, Taj Island, Nampally T Junction, Nampally Railway Station, Public Garden, and Gunpark. Commuters are advised to use alternate routes and avoid BJR, Basheerbagh, and Gunpark areas.
@HYDTP Officers are ensuring smooth traffic flow.
